.
.  Macro to generate geometric representation of 2x2 design
.  with sample response values
.
device 1 x11
device 2 gd jpeg
device 2 picture points 200 200
.
xlimits 300 350
ylimits 20 30
major tic mark number 2
minor tic mark number 0
tic mark label format alpha
x1tic mark label content -1cr()300  +1cr()350
y1tic mark label content -1cr()20  +1cr()30
ytic offset 1 1
xtic offset 10 30
tic offset units data
.
frame pattern blank
label case asis
x1label sp()cr()X1: Temperature
y1label X2: Time
label size 5
tic label size 5
.
read x y tag
300 20 1
350 20 2
350 30 3
300 30 4
375 28 5
end of data
character 2 4 8 6 x
character size 5 all
line bl bl bl bl bl
.
plot y x tag
line solid
drawdata 290 19 360 19 360 31 290 31 290 19
.
device 2 close
system mv dppl1f.dat  2x2des5.jpeg
.
quit
